#AREA Gorthesus's Abode~
#AUTHORS Hupster Hup~

#RANGES 50 60 0 99

#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOTELEPORT

#HELPS
-1 GORTHESUS ABODE~
{110} Gorthesus is the 9th generation son of the mighty hero of Order Gilikak.
He strives to live his life in the valiant manner of his great for father.  He
has built a small house on the grounds next to Gilikak's Mansion,  where he 
works to gain knowledge and power to build his own legacy.  He has been
known to help others in their own quest for holiness.

{160}Created 8-98 Hupster
~

-1 HELP_RING~ 
{170}Alfred pulls from his breast pocket a small ring.
~
-1 HELP_PACE~
{110}Gorthesus paces back and forth impatiently.
~
-1 HELP_SQUAWK~
{170}The Owl squawks loudly at you angrily.
~
-1 HELP_BONE~
{170}The sage opens the small pouch and sprinkles some bone powder upon the ring of enchantment.
~
-1 HELP_RING2~
{170}The Sage rubs the ring lightly and it glows in an errie{120} green light.
~

-1 HELP_KISS~
{170}The concubine grabs your shirt and pulls you close to her heaving breasts
{170}and lays her full lips upon yours.
~
-1 HELP_MOVE~
{170}You feel disoriented as you open your eyes to new surrounding's
~
-1 HELP_RUMAGE~
{170}The sage rummages within his robes searching for something.
~
-1 HELP_GORTH~
{170}Gorthesus kneels here upon his prayer rug forehead to the ground in deep
{170}thought.  He raises his head slightly upon your arrival.
~

0 $~


