#2754
Gorthesus gorth_mob~
The mighty Gorthesus~
The 9th generation son of Gilikak kneels here praying to Lord Order.~
The young man is adorned in white robes of the finest fabric.  Power and
intelligence emanates form his stout frame.~
ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_DETECT_INVIS
251 S
65 BODY_HAND BODY_LEG 5d20+6999 7d6+41
222560 0
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>rand_prog 3~
if quest(0,5,self) == 13
   mpquiet on
      cast "feast"
   mpquiet off
   say I must be..
   mpforce all help help_pace
endif
~
>rand_prog 10~
drop all
sac all
~
>rand_prog 60~
if quest(0,5,self) == 2
   mpforce sage_mob say It is about our guest here. $n
   ponder
   mpforce sage_mob say He came to me seeking an audience with you.
   mpmset self quest 0 5 3
   break
endif 
if quest(0,5,self) == 3
   mpforce sage_mob say I sent him away on a fruitless quest to seek his own answer.
   mpforce sage_mob say It seems he returned with Truth.
   ponder
   mpmset self quest 0 5 4
   break
endif
if quest(0,5,self) == 4
   say Truth!.. You have found it?
   mpforce sage_mob say It seems Master that.. that..
   say What. What!?
   mpmset self quest 0 5 5
   break
endif
if quest(0,5,self) == 5
   mpforce sage_mob Well.. it seems that this person is the answer to your question.
   say WHAT!?
   mpforce sage_mob Yes Master.. It seems that it is so..
   sigh
   mpmset self quest 0 5 6
   break
endif
if quest(0,5,self) == 6
   say Leave us Sage..
   mpforce sage_mob say As you wish..
   mpforce sage_mob goto 2770
   say So you are my answer are you?
   say Well are you? 
   mpmset self quest 0 5 0
break
endif
if quest(0,5,self) == 7
   say I suppose that I should share with you my problem.
   sigh Well as you may know I am the ninth generation grandson of the Mighty Gilikak.
   say It is my quest in life to lead a pure and true life like my forefather.
   mpmset self quest 0 5 8
   break
endif
if quest(0,5,self) == 8
   say I have prayed to Lord Order for 40 days and 40 nights for an answer to my 
   question.
   say My question is "How can I live a holy life in the eyes of my peers?"
   sigh
   mpmset self quest 0 5 9
   break
endif
if quest(0,5,self) == 9
   say If you posses the answer you must tell me.
   say Please $n share with my your insight into my problem.
   sigh
   mpforce all help help_pace
   mpmset self quest 0 5 10
   break
endif
if quest(0,5,self) == 10
   say How can I live a holy life in the eyes of my peers?
   say Help me $n.
   sigh
   mpmset self quest 0 5 11
break
endif
if quest(0,5,self) == 11
   say I must lead my life in a manner which is acceptable to all.
   say I must be..
   sigh
   mpmset self quest 0 5 12
   break
endif
if quest(0,5,self) == 12
   say I must be humble.. I must be pious.. I must be...
   say Help me My friend.
   mpforce all help help_pace
   mpmset self quest 0 5 13
   break
endif
~
