#2750
Front Lawn~
Standing before a relatively small house in comparison to Gilikak's Mansion, 
you walk slowly along a pebbled path over a wide expanse of green lawn.
The building seems to be entirely constructed of white marble and limestone.
Tall graceful pillars support the overhang of the second floor above the porch. 
~
